{"id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-jump-monotonicity.md","title":"原书正生成算子在完整幂集上单调","display":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 原书正生成算子在完整幂集上单调","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity","aliases":["91-lem-jump-monotonicity","91-lem-kripke-monotonicity"],"display":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 原书正生成算子在完整幂集上单调","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-jump-monotonicity</span><span>91-lem-kripke-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 原书正生成算子在完整幂集上单调"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a> 中的十三子句正生成算子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X,Y\\subseteq C_T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}jump\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\\quad\nX\\subseteq Y\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad J(X)\\subseteq J(Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}jump\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\\quad\nX\\subseteq Y\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad J(X)\\subseteq J(Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐条检查 Definition 15.5：测试项值、句法类别和非句子条件均与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 无关；其余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 只正出现于成员关系、有限合取/析取或数域量词中，故见证或全称成立由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 传递到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>。因此结论在允许过剩的完整幂集上也成立。\n旧证明讨论一次递归评估整句的算子；该算子与此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 有相同固定点但阶段不同，不能混用。单调性不蕴含保持有向并，量词子句提供反例。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5 及其后单调性说明，印刷页 188–189，PDF 页 199–200。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$ 为 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 中的十三子句正生成算子；$X,Y\\subseteq C_T$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}jump\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\\quad\nX\\subseteq Y\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad J(X)\\subseteq J(Y).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":1253,"backlinks":[{"id":"9360972f9b2f8524","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3986b1fdb85a0caf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]"}],"outgoing":["ae9eced0b12cbd2a"]}